[00:01.15]1. Throughout our lifetime, We want to use each day
[00:11.61]To make a good name And all God’s laws obey.
[00:26.81]If in Jehovah’s sight We strive to do what’s right,
[00:32.44]Then we will please him, To his delight.
[00:42.94]2. This world may cause us To try to make a name,
[00:53.24]To seek its favor, To bask in its acclaim.
[01:08.74]But that is vanity, For if its friend we’ll be,
[01:18.74]Jehovah’s favor, We will not see.
[01:24.67]3. In God’s remembrance, We want our name to be
[01:35.17]And have a good name For all eternity.
[01:45.88]On him we can depend, So we his truth defend
[02:10.84]And keep our good name Down to the end.